          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Jamtara Is Old News: How AI-Powered Synthetic Identity Fraud Is Now Threatening India's Digital Lenders",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "As India's digital lending sector scales rapidly, AI-powered synthetic identity fraud has emerged as a structural threat to the underwriting models that lenders rely upon, according to a YourStory analysis. Fraudsters are now using generative AI to construct convincing fake identities — combining real and fabricated personal data — that pass conventional KYC and credit scoring checks, forcing lenders to rethink risk assessment from the ground up. The piece argues that fraud is no longer a downstream compliance problem but has become an upstream design challenge embedded in how digital credit is originated in India.",
            "url": "https://yourstory.com/2026/04/jamtara-was-just-the-trailer-fraud-runs-on-ai-now",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
